This is a learning/lab setup, not hardened for production — adapt secrets/credentials before reusing.

## Things to Change
PKI - Generate your own keys
Stable Config - Change the user settings
Drive Mounts - Configure as needed

Make sure all file paths listed for the NixOS exist and are given correct permissions or the lab will not work.

